Compilation flags:
========================================
Enable : HYDRO
Disable: PARTICLE, GRAVITY, MHD


Default setup:
========================================
1. BOX_SIZE = 1 kpc
2. simulation time = 8.0 Myr
3. Units: in cgs
4. Enable SRC_EXACTCOOLING_GENERAL
5. The factor of the cooling time-step SRC_EXACTCOOLING_GENERAL_DT is 0.3
6. Enable OPT__OUTPUT_USER to output the temperature evolution


Note:
========================================
1. This test problem is for testing the exact cooling scheme (reference: Townsend 2009)
2. The analytical solution and simulation error will be recorded in the Record__CoolingErr file when OPT__OUTPUT_USER is enabled.
3. plot_ExactCooling.py is for plotting the evolution of temperature.
4. Run the test problem first then modify "END_T" in Input__Parameter to about "t1" in Record__CoolingErr.
5. Modify the source term ExactCooling_General to your piecewise power law cooling function
6. Please use cgs units.
